# Project Coding & Agent Rules
- Always inspect existing files before proposing edits.
- Keep edits minimal, atomic, and strictly scoped to the requested task.
- Never delete existing tests or suppress TypeScript/linter errors with `any` or `@ts-ignore`.
- After modifying code, run the project's test suite via terminal to verify zero regressions.
- Prefer standard library or existing project dependencies over introducing new packages.
